// Step 1: Load the JVMTI library
System.loadLibrary("jvmti");

// Step 2: Get the JVMTI agent context
AgentContext agentContext = Agent.Onload();

// Step 3: Define a class loader
agentContext.SetDeterministicGlobalRoot();
agentContext.CreateAgentClassLoader("CustomClassLoader", (internedClassLoader) -> {
    // Load a custom class
    internedClassLoader.LoadClass("my.custom.Class");
});
```
This code loads a custom class using a custom class loader.

